Package: transmap
Type: Package
Title: Multiscale Mapping of Trans-Regulatory QTL
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xuewei", "Cao", email = "xc2270@cumc.columbia.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds program phenotypes for trans-QTL mapping at two scales.
    Local programs summarize co-expression gene modules, detected with an R
    implementation of Hotspot, by whitened principal components (WPC), the
    first or adaptively chosen principal components, or AUCell scores. Global
    programs are sparse gene sets jointly associated with trans variants,
    identified by penalized matrix decomposition of marginal trans-QTL
    z-scores (transCCA).
